<title>GERMANY: Messer Griesheim 96 net profit higher.</title>
<headline>Messer Griesheim 96 net profit higher.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   184     vs 164</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		   330     vs 303</p>
<p>    Group cash flow from ord. activities 522     vs 423</p>
<p>    Group sales				  2,470   vs 2,392</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    7,235   vs 7,347</p>
<p>    Group investment			   572     vs 499</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German industrial gas producer is Messer Griesheim, a subsidiary of Hoechst AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
